Quantum Mechanics: This branch of physics deals with the behavior of matter and energy at the smallest scale. Some interpretations of quantum mechanics suggest that the universe exists in multiple states simultaneously, and the act of observation collapses these possibilities into a single reality. This could be seen as a way in which the universe "knows" about all possible outcomes.
